## Model weights are not covered

This license covers the code in this repository only. The ONNX weights named
in `deploy/WEIGHTS.md` are supplied by the operator and remain under their own
terms: InsightFace buffalo_l is non-commercial research; Ultralytics and
OpenAI CLIP have their own terms. This repository does not grant rights to
those weights.
